==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|computing|lang=en}} The way in which [[symbol]]s are mapped onto [[byte]]s, e.g. in the rendering of a particular [[font]], or in the mapping from keyboard input into visual text.
# A conversion of plain text into a code or [[cypher]] form (for [[decoding]] by the recipient).

